    "Eleven invalid controls reject, including palette exhaustion and edge-only apparent disambiguation. All21 valid and10 rejection critic cases pass.",
    "Corrected documentation of lattice-size sampling bias. Three-cell masks are directly sampled as the two diagonals instead of spending up to200 growth retries. Default histogram and dimensions are saved."
